    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on some internal guidelines for a new social media platform we're launching. i need to clarify our stance on content moderation, specifically for political satire. can you give me a summary of the current industry standard for when political satire should be flagged as hate speech versus when it should be protected?",
